        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501409",
      "subQuestName": "Leave the northern camp",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750141320"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750141320": {
            "id": "750141320",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon was so worried that she broke out in a cold sweat! Good thing she hid, or else that lady would have caught Paimon instead of paying attention to you two Saurians!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141321"
            ]
          },
          "750141321": {
            "id": "750141321",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You escaped without us...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141322"
            ]
          },
          "750141322": {
            "id": "750141322",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Wrroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141323"
            ]
          },
          "750141323": {
            "id": "750141323",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Any slower, and this would have become an impossible crime...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141324"
            ]
          },
          "750141324": {
            "id": "750141324",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Wrroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141325"
            ]
          },
          "750141325": {
            "id": "750141325",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure, no one can accuse the Iktomisaur... Well, you, but don't say scary stuff like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141326"
            ]
          },
          "750141326": {
            "id": "750141326",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A—Anyway, Paimon was just making adjustments to the plan on the fly! You wouldn't have been able to get away if she hadn't caused a commotion outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141327"
            ]
          },
          "750141327": {
            "id": "750141327",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure was lucky that the box was filled with Saurus Crackers. The Iktomisaurs swarmed all over them after the box was knocked over. It was pandemonium!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141328"
            ]
          },
          "750141328": {
            "id": "750141328",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Paimon didn't see Lamizana outside either, or the people who'd taken part in the transaction earlier. Seems like neither one was Lamizana, though. Their voices sounded different.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141329"
            ]
          },
          "750141329": {
            "id": "750141329",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Either way, let's tell Taruka what we saw and heard earlier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501410",
      "subQuestName": "Report your findings to Taruka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750141001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750141001": {
            "id": "750141001",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}! Thank goodness you're safe. I was so worried.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141002"
            ]
          },
          "750141002": {
            "id": "750141002",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It sure was thrilling! But, uh... But it's a bit hard to describe, so we'll discuss that later...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141003"
            ]
          },
          "750141003": {
            "id": "750141003",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell Taruka what you saw and heard at the camp...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141004"
            ]
          },
          "750141004": {
            "id": "750141004",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "Really? You saw Ms. Quilla, but not Lamizana...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141005"
            ]
          },
          "750141005": {
            "id": "750141005",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, they mentioned an air race and a transaction. Paimon doesn't know the details, but it sounds like it's for something that will be used during the race.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141006"
            ]
          },
          "750141006": {
            "id": "750141006",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "Ms. Quilla is a traveling merchant who showed up recently. According to Paran, she deals in a wide variety of goods. Maybe Lamizana purchased something dangerous from her...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141007"
            ]
          },
          "750141007": {
            "id": "750141007",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "I see. So he wants to carry out his dangerous plan during the air race!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141010"
            ]
          },
          "750141010": {
            "id": "750141010",
            "speakerId": 6173,
            "speakerName": "Taruka",
            "text": "I don't know... but I'm sure he's plotting something dangerous!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141011"
            ]
          },
          "750141011": {
            "id": "750141011",
            "speakerId": 6168,
            "speakerName": "Paran",
            "text": "#Ah, so this is where you are. Wonderful! You must be {NICKNAME}, right? Lamizana tells me that you've tried out the training course and that you did quite well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501401",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750140152"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750140152": {
            "id": "750140152",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Lamizana should be <color=#00E1FFFF>deeper within</color> if he really is here, right? After all, he's gonna want this discussion hidden from others!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750140153"
            ]
          },
          "750140153": {
            "id": "750140153",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If only we could <color=#00E1FFFF>sneak in among the Iktomisaurs</color>..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501416",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750141601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750141601": {
            "id": "750141601",
            "speakerId": 6172,
            "speakerName": "Lliwa",
            "text": "Ugh, this is trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141603",
              "750141606"
            ]
          },
          "750141603": {
            "id": "750141603",
            "speakerId": 6172,
            "speakerName": "Lliwa",
            "text": "Well, I have a little brother who's a lot younger than me. Maybe it's because he's in his rebellious years, but he doesn't get along with anyone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750141604"
            ]
          },
          "750141604": {
            "id": "750141604",
            "speakerId": 6172,
            "speakerName": "Lliwa",
            "text": "Bah, I'll only add to your troubles by telling you about this. Things will probably get better when he grows up!"
          },
          "750141606": {
            "id": "750141606",
            "speakerId": 6172,
            "speakerName": "Lliwa",
            "text": "It's no trouble. See you around."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508757",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750875701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750875701": {
            "id": "750875701",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "We still have a few more flying challenges. Details are written on the board. Give 'em a try if you're keen... Of course, there are prizes to be won.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875703",
              "750875706",
              "750875710"
            ]
          },
          "750875703": {
            "id": "750875703",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "Honestly, I have no clue why it's called that. But speaking of Pakpaka... Have you ever heard the story of Kuntur and the evil sorcerer Rumi?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875704"
            ]
          },
          "750875704": {
            "id": "750875704",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "The warriors of the tribe were defeated by that wicked mage, and he turned them into Pakpaka... which doesn't sound all that good. Maybe Pakpakas fly very quickly, or something — I don't know."
          },
          "750875706": {
            "id": "750875706",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "Haha... He's a good fighter, but not necessarily a good teacher. And as an opponent in flying competitions... I guess he's passable?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875707"
            ]
          },
          "750875707": {
            "id": "750875707",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "But I mean, why would you come here if you didn't have issues with flying? So, if I were to be too strict... *sigh* Well, it's not like things like this have never happened in the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750875708"
            ]
          },
          "750875708": {
            "id": "750875708",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "That's why I focus on encouraging people nowadays. I'm sure that approach will get results just fine too."
          },
          "750875710": {
            "id": "750875710",
            "speakerId": 6274,
            "speakerName": "Temach",
            "text": "See you. You're welcome back any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508761",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750876101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750876101": {
            "id": "750876101",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Welcome to Pakpaka Flying School!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876104",
              "750876107"
            ]
          },
          "750876104": {
            "id": "750876104",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "We give all cadets the necessary guidance and help they need. Things have changed a lot, you know. Back in the day, students couldn't expect that kind of tender loving care.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876105"
            ]
          },
          "750876105": {
            "id": "750876105",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "But then there was this one time when the coach was a little... strict with their words, and the student in question just happened to have quite a temper... *sigh* Yeah, that's not a fun one to talk about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750876106"
            ]
          },
          "750876106": {
            "id": "750876106",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Anyway, our teaching policy's been shaken up since then. And I mean, nobody slaps a smiling face, and nobody hates compliments, am I right?"
          },
          "750876107": {
            "id": "750876107",
            "speakerId": 6275,
            "speakerName": "Cisik",
            "text": "Here's to a pleasant day!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7508764",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750876401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750876401": {
            "id": "750876401",
            "speakerId": 21773,
            "speakerName": "Oberon",
            "text": "Taruka seems unhappy. What happened...?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}